## Controllers & Routes

### API Base URL: `/api/v1`

| Method | Endpoint | Controller | Description |
|--------|----------|------------|-------------|
| **GET** | `/tours` | `TourController.getAll` | List tours — supports `?category=`, `?destination=`, `?maxPrice=`, `?q=`, `?tour_type=` |
| **GET** | `/tours/featured` | `TourController.getFeatured` | Featured tours shown on Home page card grid |
| **GET** | `/tours/special` | `TourController.getSpecial` | `tour_type=special` tours for "Special Tours" section |
| **GET** | `/tours/popular` | `TourController.getPopular` | `tour_type=popular` tours |
| **GET** | `/tours/:slug` | `TourController.getOne` | Single tour by slug or id |
| **POST** | `/tours` | `TourController.create` | Create tour (admin only) |
| **PATCH** | `/tours/:id` | `TourController.update` | Update tour (admin only) |
| **DELETE** | `/tours/:id` | `TourController.delete` | Delete tour (admin only) |
| **GET** | `/tours/:id/reviews` | `ReviewController.getForTour` | Reviews for a tour |
| **POST** | `/tours/:id/reviews` | `ReviewController.create` | Post review (auth required) |
| **GET** | `/destinations` | `DestinationController.getAll` | All destination icons (for Home icon row) |
| **POST** | `/destinations` | `DestinationController.create` | Add new destination icon (admin) |
| **POST** | `/inquiries` | `InquiryController.create` | Submit contact/expedition inquiry form |
| **GET** | `/inquiries` | `InquiryController.getAll` | Admin: list all inquiries |
| **PATCH** | `/inquiries/:id` | `InquiryController.updateStatus` | Admin: update inquiry status |
| **POST** | `/auth/register` | `AuthController.register` | User registration |
| **POST** | `/auth/login` | `AuthController.login` | Login → returns JWT stored as `kmt_token` |
| **GET** | `/auth/me` | `AuthController.getMe` | Current user (auth required) |

